  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">THE</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987220/description_3267c687-09d6-4785-a521-0876ebef4910.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">作者：Smoreh</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EhYW1b4RoKs\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>目前功能</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>擁有專屬模型、張開的大嘴、體型比玩家更大、會對你造成激怒效果、以四足站立。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>激怒龍尺寸：<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">高達9.5個方塊</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">下個月更新內容</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>破壞方塊以接近你、垂直方塊破壞、自訂生成蛋、完全移除居住者AI、新模型/動畫、新增眼睛、擊殺動畫。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987220/description_417e6e19-57b4-45ff-9c51-7e99de21e2e8.png\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>超棒的字幕修正！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/987220/description_42e1eda4-4672-44c4-a0e2-15fb9909003c.png\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>音效、模型、動畫、字幕修正、生成蛋修正、整體外觀重製。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><em>重要：需要GECKOLIB才能讓動畫正常運作</em></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>如果你為這個模組製作影片，無論你在YouTube上的頻道規模大小，我們都會將影片放在這裡！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/x26ILQ1fz-M?t=152s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HkT4LnBOc6s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sM9Xn1KaPmE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GpWV2uSTdc4?t=543s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_jBZcAahLLM\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIfRF-FQoCs\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5ilsPZZ1se4\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mbl